        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "volume of crime) would be necessary in an effort to examine the contours of any possible relationship between the quality of crimes reported and lunar cycles. Only then could this question of the lunar lore and crime be more fully answered.",
          "block_bbox": [
            61,
            111,
